# Call Analyzer

Follow the root `AGENTS.md`. Current source code defines behavior and contracts; documentation describes the verified implementation. When those disagree, inspect the call path and do not repeat the stale claim.

Use the canonical skills in `.agents/skills` for verification, Wails contracts, and SQLite migrations. Cursor compatibility pointers live in `.cursor/skills`.

Keep checks offline: do not run `go run ./cmd/evaluate -execute` or send live lesson audio unless the user asks. Preserve unrelated changes and report checks that could not be run.
